+/* Runtime emulation for older hosts: MOVBE/BMI1/LZCNT/POPCNT/CRC32 and a conservative AVX
+ * subset. The AVX scanner fails closed on any instruction not implemented below. The original
+ * MOVBE/BMI1/LZCNT code is from gow3_pc (FelipePrado0/gow3_pc, GPL-2.0-or-later). */
